  "id": "18559",
  "key": "SFCC-282",
  "summary": "Cart - Out of Stock and Partial Out of Stock",
  "description": "**As a** Shopper, I want to be clearly informed when an item in my bag is unavailable or has limited stock, so that I can take the appropriate action before proceeding to checkout.\n\nThis story covers the **behaviour and interaction between multiple cart components** when a cart line item is fully out of stock or has limited stock — it is not a component build story. The following components must be developed before this story can be implemented end to end:\n\n  - **Cart Item component* — renders the quantity stepper and inline error message (see [SFCC-795](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-795) )\n  - **Page-level error banner* — renders the banner at the top of the cart drawer (see [SFCC-404](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-404) )\n  - **Order summary* — renders the error message above the Checkout CTA (see [SFCC-274](https://zimmermannworkboard.atlassian.net/browse/SFCC-274) )\n  - **Checkout / Apple Pay / Google Pay CTA* — disabled when OOS or limited stock is detected\n\n*Cart Designs:* [https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann*Designs?node-id=7383-167057&t=fNANwHd5P8MwAxVA-0](https://www.figma.com/design/QQ427wHWEUjsjP7H8v48Rs/Zimmermann*Designs) \n\n*UI Kit:* [https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026?node-id=2129-19977&p=f&t=X5fHFHkybHS9wAkf-0](https://www.figma.com/design/wPiWmZZOVKnrENUWk2XWWm/Zimmermann*Design*System*2026)  \n\nNote: Checkout CTA should appear enabled.\n\nFully OOS\n\n![\"image-20260825-052827.png\"](image-20260825-052827.png)\n\nPartially OOS\n\n![\"image-20260825-052845.png\"](image-20260825-052845.png)",
